<title>USA: First Colonial sets 5 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>First Colonial sets 5 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Colonial Group Inc said it declared a five percent common stock dividend payable June 19 to holders of record May 30.</p>
</text>
